public boolImagick::quantizeImage intnumberColors intcolorspace inttreedepth booldither boolmeasureError
Reduces the number of unique colors in the image to at most numberColors. The colors of the image are analyzed to choose the set of colors which best represents it, and each pixel is then mapped to a color of that set. The goal of the algorithm is to minimize the color difference between the input and output image while minimizing the processing time.

  &reftitle.examples;



       Imagick::quantizeImage


<?php
function quantizeImage($imagePath, $numberColors, $colorSpace, $treeDepth, $dither) {
    $imagick = new \Imagick(realpath($imagePath));
    $imagick->quantizeImage($numberColors, $colorSpace, $treeDepth, $dither, false);
    $imagick->setImageFormat('png');
    header("Content-Type: image/png");
    echo $imagick->getImageBlob();
}

?>
